  <item>
    <title>E10 生意分析：谁是中国的喜诗糖果？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a7ed18293471fed4e0fb81</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68a7ed18293471fed4e0fb81</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 22 Aug 2025 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>喜诗糖果（See's Candies）算得上价值投资里“圣杯”级别的案例，值得花时间研究透彻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们也经常听到五花八门的“xx就是中国的喜诗糖果”的说法，如果真是如此都可以直接买爆，所以到底要怎么鉴别？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期我们把这一个标杆型的生意给聊透。</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下是Alice这次美国之行给我们带来的现场照片：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsYvIbJxEB30YjZ2_z5xlmC0W3Hv.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fszk8tgi8avPCQJ0OMvDY6t3G7GP.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl3HU1jISN4Loxa_k82tlGAKUvTo.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llipf0hSwAncgtwNTN-BfTUZeOS6.jpg"></figure><span></span><h2><span>---</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>时间轴</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7">00:07</a> 契机</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="261">04:21</a> 喜诗历史和简介</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> 巴菲特收购交易和投资背景</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1094">18:14</a> 巴菲特自己的投资复盘</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1612">26:52</a> 我们学到的东西</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1641">27:21</a> 好的商业模式？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3435">57:15</a> 好的文化？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3666">1:01:06</a> 好的价格？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3839">1:03:59</a> 对喜诗可能的一些偏见</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4119">1:08:39</a> 谁可能是中国的喜诗糖果？</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>---</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>收听与交流</span></h2><span></span><p><span>你可以在小宇宙、苹果播客、QQ音乐和Spotify中搜索、收听及订阅本节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你也可以通过邮件 </span><a href="mailto: soslowisfast@gmail.com"><span>soslowisfast@gmail.com</span></a><span> 或在雪球上找到 </span><a href="https://xueqiu.com/u/rhythmzz" data-url="https://xueqiu.com/u/rhythmzz"><span>正常派</span></a><span> 与主播交流。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>---</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>其他资源</span></h2><span></span><p><a href="https://weread.qq.com/misc/booklist/37995103_7YiVfVKEJ" data-url="https://weread.qq.com/misc/booklist/37995103_7YiVfVKEJ"><span>《慢慢变富书单》</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>---</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>关于「慢慢变富」</span></h2><span></span><p><span>- 把价值投资大师们的精髓翻译成新手村的平民语言，配上实例分析，拨开云雾</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 分析各路生意，探讨怎么把生意做好</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 找到同路人，在投资的大道上一起慢慢变富</span></p><span></span><p><span>* 若涉及具体公司及证券，不构成任何投资建议</span></p>]]></description>
